// Logline: Unified standard library package providing autograd DAGs, neural layers (Linear, Conv2D, Norm, Attention), and AdamW.
//
// Setup: Root machine learning package re-exporting neural layers, loss functions, and optimization engines.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Re-export reverse-mode Autograd tape execution.
//   2. Re-export neural layer architectures: Linear, Conv2D, LayerNorm, Multi-Head Attention.
//   3. Re-export objective loss functions (MSE, Cross-Entropy) and analytical gradients.
//   4. Re-export AdamW and SGD optimization parameter solvers.

